                    RehabCare Hospital is a leading rehabilitation center in the Philippines, dedicated to providing world-class therapy services that help patients regain their independence and improve their quality of life.
                </p>
                <div class="row mb-3">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:16px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#0cb8b6; font-size:18px; margin-right:10px; margin-top:2px;"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color:#1a2942;">Licensed Therapists</strong>
                                <p style="color:#888; font-size:13px; margin:0;">All staff are PRC licensed</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:16px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#0cb8b6; font-size:18px; margin-right:10px; margin-top:2px;"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color:#1a2942;">Modern Facilities</strong>
                                <p style="color:#888; font-size:13px; margin:0;">State of the art equipment</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#0cb8b6; font-size:18px; margin-right:10px; margin-top:2px;"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color:#1a2942;">Personalized Care</strong>
                                <p style="color:#888; font-size:13px; margin:0;">Tailored therapy programs</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#0cb8b6; font-size:18px; margin-right:10px; margin-top:2px;"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color:#1a2942;">Easy Booking</strong>
                                <p style="color:#888; font-size:13px; margin:0;">Book online anytime</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a href="/UserAccount/BookAppointment" class="btn-style-one" style="padding:12px 28px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Book an Appointment
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 70px 0; background:#1a2942;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 style="font-size:34px; font-weight:800; color:#fff;">Your Recovery Journey</h2>
            <p style="color:#aaa; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;">Watch how our rehabilitation process works and how our therapists guide patients to full recovery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); position:relative; background:#000;">
                 
                    <video autoplay muted loop controls style="width:100%; display:block;">
                        <source src="~/Content/videos/rehab.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                        Your browser does not support the video tag.
                    </video>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 70px 0; background:#f0f4f8;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 style="font-size:34px; font-weight:800; color:#1a2942;">How to Book an Appointment</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="row text-center">
            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div style="width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:50%; background:#0cb8b6; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
                    <span style="color:#fff; font-size:22px; font-weight:800;">1</span>
                </div>
                <h5 style="color:#1a2942; font-weight:700;">Create Account</h5>
                <p style="color:#888; font-size:14px;">Register for a free account to get started with our booking system.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div style="width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:50%; background:#1a2942; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
                    <span style="color:#fff; font-size:22px; font-weight:800;">2</span>
                </div>
                <h5 style="color:#1a2942; font-weight:700;">Choose a Service</h5>
                <p style="color:#888; font-size:14px;">Select the therapy service that best fits your needs and condition.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div style="width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:50%; background:#0cb8b6; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
                    <span style="color:#fff; font-size:22px; font-weight:800;">3</span>
                </div>
                <h5 style="color:#1a2942; font-weight:700;">Pick a Schedule</h5>
                <p style="color:#888; font-size:14px;">Choose your preferred date and time from available therapist slots.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div style="width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:50%; background:#1a2942; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
                    <span style="color:#fff; font-size:22px; font-weight:800;">4</span>
                </div>
                <h5 style="color:#1a2942; font-weight:700;">Attend Session</h5>
                <p style="color:#888; font-size:14px;">Come in for your session and begin your recovery journey with us.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center mt-3">
            <a href="/UserAccount/BookAppointment" class="btn-style-one" style="padding:14px 40px; font-size:15px;">
                <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Get Started Now
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
